  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Antiderivatives, definite integrals, and the area under a curve — the closing strand of school calculus.",
          "ar": "المشتقات العكسية، والتكاملات المحددة، والمساحة تحت المنحنى — المحور الختامي لتفاضل وتكامل المرحلة الثانوية."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Integration",
          "ar": "▲ مرجع — التكامل"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\( \\displaystyle\\int x^{n}\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+C \\) (for \\( n\\neq-1 \\)). A definite integral \\( \\displaystyle\\int_a^b f=F(b)-F(a) \\) measures the signed area under \\( f \\).",
          "ar": "\\( \\displaystyle\\int x^{n}\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+C \\) (عندما \\( n\\neq-1 \\)). يقيس التكامل المحدد \\( \\displaystyle\\int_a^b f=F(b)-F(a) \\) المساحة المُوجَّهة تحت \\( f \\)."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Power rule",
              "ar": "قاعدة القوة"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+C \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Definite",
              "ar": "المحدد"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( F(b)-F(a) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Constant",
              "ar": "الثابت"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\displaystyle\\int k\\,dx=kx+C \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Area",
              "ar": "المساحة"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\displaystyle\\int_a^b f\\,dx \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 7.A",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 7.أ"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Evaluate \\( \\displaystyle\\int_0^2 3x^{2}\\,dx \\). \\[ \\big[x^{3}\\big]_0^2=8. \\]",
          "ar": "احسب \\( \\displaystyle\\int_0^2 3x^{2}\\,dx \\). \\[ \\big[x^{3}\\big]_0^2=8. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 7.B",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 7.ب"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Find the area under \\( y=x \\) from \\( 0 \\) to \\( 4 \\). \\[ \\int_0^4 x\\,dx=\\Big[\\tfrac{x^{2}}{2}\\Big]_0^4=8. \\]",
          "ar": "أوجد المساحة تحت \\( y=x \\) من \\( 0 \\) إلى \\( 4 \\). \\[ \\int_0^4 x\\,dx=\\Big[\\tfrac{x^{2}}{2}\\Big]_0^4=8. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": "سؤال تدريبي"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Evaluate \\(\\displaystyle\\int_1^3(2x^2-3x+1)\\,dx.\\) <details><summary>Show solution</summary><div>Antiderivative: \\(F(x)=\\dfrac{2x^3}{3}-\\dfrac{3x^2}{2}+x.\\) \\(F(3)=18-\\frac{27}{2}+3=\\frac{42-27}{2}+3=\\frac{15}{2}+3=\\frac{21}{2}.\\) \\(F(1)=\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{3}{2}+1=\\frac{4-9+6}{6}=\\frac{1}{6}.\\) Integral\\(=\\frac{21}{2}-\\frac{1}{6}=\\frac{63-1}{6}=\\frac{62}{6}=\\frac{31}{3}\\approx10.33.\\)</div></details>",
          "ar": "احسب \\(\\displaystyle\\int_1^3(2x^2-3x+1)\\,dx.\\) <details><summary>عرض الحل</summary><div>المشتقة العكسية: \\(F(x)=\\dfrac{2x^3}{3}-\\dfrac{3x^2}{2}+x.\\) \\(F(3)=18-\\frac{27}{2}+3=\\frac{42-27}{2}+3=\\frac{15}{2}+3=\\frac{21}{2}.\\) \\(F(1)=\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{3}{2}+1=\\frac{4-9+6}{6}=\\frac{1}{6}.\\) التكامل\\(=\\frac{21}{2}-\\frac{1}{6}=\\frac{63-1}{6}=\\frac{62}{6}=\\frac{31}{3}\\approx10.33.\\)</div></details>"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
